# No shims

SSOT: [`docs/standards/no-backward-compat.md`](../../docs/standards/no-backward-compat.md).

- Pre-1.0: rename/remove outright — no alias / `@deprecated` re-export.
- One change updates symbol, call sites, tests, examples, docs.
- No inline diagnostic disables to “ship later.”
